// One Learn target across switches (0..3), controllers (4..7), phrases (8..23).
// Reserved schema-3 fields +24/+25 store controller channel (0 legacy ANY) / kind.
// Fields +27..30 store exact phrase-trigger channels (0 legacy ANY).
